## Codebase Audit Summary

### 1. Repository Subsystems Discovered
- **Core App & Routing**: Next.js 16 (App Router + Turbopack), Server Actions, Middleware permission guard (`src/middleware.ts`), Multi-tenant context (`src/lib/tenant/`).
- **Authentication & Security**: Supabase Auth (Cookie-based SSR), Custom RLS Policies, AES-256-GCM BYOK Provider Key Encryption (`src/lib/security/encryption.ts`), Role Hierarchy (`guest`, `student`, `instructor`, `admin`, `super_admin`, `developer`).
- **AI Agent System & BYOK**:
  - Controller & State Machine: `src/lib/ai/agent-controller.ts`
  - Engine & Fast Path: `src/lib/ai/agent.ts`, `src/lib/ai/client-fast-path.ts`
  - Tool Registry: `src/lib/ai/agent-tools.ts` (30+ tools), `agent-tool-declarations.ts`
  - Context & Memory: `src/lib/ai/live-dom-reader.ts`, `live-dom-executor.ts`, `agent-memory.ts`
  - Live Voice & VAD: `gemini-live-session.ts`, `adaptive-vad.ts`, `speech-recorder.ts`, `speech-synthesizer.ts`, `gemini-audio-player.ts`
  - BYOK Providers: `GeminiProvider.ts` (`gemini-3.6-flash`), `GrokProvider.ts` (`grok-2-1212` / `XAI_MODEL`), `factory.ts`
- **Standalone In-Browser / Backend Engines**:
  - **In-Browser SQL Engine**: `src/lib/sql/` (`parser.ts`, `executor.ts`, `tokenizer.ts`, `formatter.ts`, `sampleDatasets.ts`)
  - **Code Execution & Judge Engine**: `src/features/code-arena/` (`execution-engine.ts`, `harness.ts`, `judge.ts`, `workspace-db.ts`)
  - **LaTeX Engine**: `src/lib/latex/` (`latex-parser.ts`, `latexTemplates.ts`, `latexValidator.ts`, `voiceCommandParser.ts`, `exportLatex.ts`)
  - **Recommendation Engine**: `src/features/analytics/services/recommendation-engine.ts`
  - **Student Intelligence & Learning Gap Engine**: `src/features/analytics/services/student-intelligence.ts`
- **Analytics & Gamification**: Student 360 analytics (`SmartAgentSessionContext.tsx`), Leaderboards (`src/features/leaderboard/`), Badges & Monthly Rankings (`src/features/gamification/`), Multi-platform Coding Sync (`src/lib/coding-platforms/` for Codeforces, LeetCode, CodeChef, GeeksforGeeks).
- **Core Learning Features**: Course Builder & Player (`src/features/courses`), Coding Battles & Dynamic Team Arena (`src/features/code-arena`), Doubt System & Likes/Replies (`src/features/doubts`), Global/Course Polls & MCQs (`src/features/polls`), Daily Routines & Goals (`src/features/goals`), Ephemeral Stories & DM Chat (`src/features/stories`, `src/features/chat`).
- **Database & Migration Layer**: 134 SQL migration scripts in `supabase/migrations/` covering RLS, triggers, indexes, search vectors, storage buckets (`avatars`, `notice-images`, `branding`, `doubt-media`, `story-media`).
- **API Inventory**: ~82 API routes under `src/app/api/` + 25+ Server Action files.

